  straddling: up=[(5, 2)]  down=[(36, 15)]
  active pair (5,36)  D=3  s=41  D/s = 3/41   matches M: True
  s <= 14D ?  41 <= 42  -> True  (LRC(14) holds here)

  independent check: scan ALL p/q with q <= 200
    best over q<=200: 3/41 at 17/41   agrees with pinch-set answer: True

